\begin_layout Section
The screen
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The screen is a 720x256 array of pixels,
 each pixel twice as high as it is wide.
 The video controller can fetch the screen data from anywhere in the bottom 128k of RAM - see port F5h below.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Subsection
