\begin_layout Description
3FFCh gives an inverted T pattern centred on F1.
 If link LK2 is present,
 it will also respond to a W/A/D/X diamond,
 with S as Fire 1 and Shift as Fire 2.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Description
3FFDh maps to the numeric keypad.
\end_layout

