The HDRIVER.FID image
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
This is an exact copy of the HDRIVER.FID used to access the hard drive when booting from floppy.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Subsection
The splash screen
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
This is a 720x146 bitmap.
 It is stored as 19 rows,
 each containing 90 8x8 character cells.
 The first row should be blank,
 because it is used to draw the 55 scanlines above and below the picture.
 
